// one that is archived, and one that bills once, by tiers, by usage, or at an
// amount the customer chooses are invalid_argument on that field, and one
// another plan of the tenant already names is already_exists on it. A tenant
// that takes no payments through Stripe is failed_precondition, and a Stripe
// that cannot be reached unavailable.
//
// `scope` is required. A SUBSCRIPTION_PLAN_SCOPE_ALL plan names neither
// labels nor series; a SUBSCRIPTION_PLAN_SCOPE_LABEL plan names one to 100
